        "type": "text/plain",
        "value": "<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <h3>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           fixed-term P\u016bkenga Iwi &amp; Hap\u016b role in Te Whare Aronui\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </h3>\r\n  <h5>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           1.0 FTE Fixed Term Full time (Maternity cover)\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </h5>\r\n  <h5>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u014ctaki Campus\n           \r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            \ufeff\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </h5>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Kia rangatira te t\u016b a Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa, hei whare ako whakatupu hoki i te m\u0101tauranga.\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Applications are now being sought to fulfill a busy and dynamic P\u016bkenga role, covering maternity-leave, within Te Whare Aronui.\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           As P\u016bkenga you will contribute to the learning journey of our tauira. This diverse role is responsible for the delivery of your tohu ensuring it is consistent with the kaupapa of Te Wananga o Raukawa.\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           The ideal candidates for these positions:\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           - Hold relevant academic qualifications and/or relevant experience in the field\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           - Have a good working knowledge of Microsoft Office 365 and M\u016brau\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           - Establish and maintain positive working relationships\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           - Communicates well in Te Reo M\u0101ori in a style suited to the intended audience.\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           - Good administration and computer skills, and\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           - Have the ability to work well within a team and multitask.\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <strong>\r\n      \n           Applications close:\n          \r\n    </strong>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Mon 29th June, 2026\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           For further information or to apply for this role contact:\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <strong>\r\n      \n           Samantha Hata, Paihere Tangata\n          \r\n    </strong>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <strong>\r\n      \n           Whare Tiaki Rawa\n          \r\n    </strong>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <a href=\"mailto:Sam.hata@twor.ac.nz\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n      <strong>\r\n        \n            Sam.hata@twor.ac.nz\n           \r\n      </strong>\r\n    </a>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>"
      }
